==English==

===Etymology===
< {{etyl|enm}} {{term|convenient|lang=enm}} < {{etyl|la}} {{term|conveniens||fit, suitable, convenient}}, ppr. of {{term|convenire||to come together, suit}}; see [[convene]] and cf. [[covenant]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-convenient.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of or pertaining to [[convenience]]; [[simple]]; [[easy]]; [[expedient]].
#: ''Fast food might be '''convenient''', but it's also very unhealthy.''

